">a </span><span begin="00:40.410" end="00:40.770">goddess</span><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:40.800">" </span><span begin="00:40.800" end="00:40.800">（</span><span begin="00:40.800" end="00:41.070">Thank </span><span begin="00:41.070" end="00:41.670">God</span><span begin="00:41.670" end="00:41.730">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.730" end="00:43.830"><span begin="00:41.730" end="00:42.030">Rule </span><span begin="00:42.030" end="00:42.330">number </span><span begin="00:42.330" end="00:42.540">two</span><span begin="00:42.540" end="00:42.540">, </span><span begin="00:42.540" end="00:42.690">don't </span><span begin="00:42.690" end="00:42.840">make </span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:42.960">the </span><span begin="00:42.960" end="00:43.830">promise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.130" end="00:46.110"><span begin="00:44.130" end="00:44.340">If </span><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:44.430">you </span><span begin="00:44.430" end="00:44.610">can't </span><span begin="00:44.610" end="00:44.790">keep </span><span begin="00:44.790" end="00:44.880">the </span><span begin="00:44.880" end="00:45.090">deal </span><span begin="00:45.090" end="00:45.240">then </span><span begin="00:45.240" end="00:45.420">just </span><span begin="00:45.420" end="00:45.570">be </span><span begin="00:45.570" end="00:46.110">honest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.110" end="00:49.360"><span begin="00:46.110" end="00:46.890">I </span><span begin="00:46.890" end="00:47.130">could </span><span begin="00:47.130" end="00:47.400">never </span><span begin="00:47.400" end="00:47.670">die</span><span begin="00:47.670" end="00:47.670">, </span><span begin="00:47.670" end="00:47.760">I'm </span><span begin="00:47.760" end="00:48.000">Chuck </span><span begin="00:48.000" end="00:48.420">Norris </span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.420">（</span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.660">Chuck </span><span begin="00:48.660" end="00:49.320">Norris</span><span begin="00:49.320